WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.353
[WIND BLOWING]

00:00:06.230 --> 00:00:12.410
(SINGING) When we met, I was
younger than a young thing

00:00:12.410 --> 00:00:13.220
can be.

00:00:26.100 --> 00:00:28.350
(SINGING) You were wet.

00:00:28.350 --> 00:00:30.570
You were hungry.

00:00:30.570 --> 00:00:34.440
You still needed me.

00:00:34.440 --> 00:00:38.750
You said I could
fly, and I flew.

00:00:41.360 --> 00:00:44.390
I remember before you knew--

00:00:44.390 --> 00:00:45.110
You taught me--

00:00:45.110 --> 00:00:48.260
--how to talk--

00:00:48.260 --> 00:00:51.863
--now I talk like you do.

00:00:51.863 --> 00:00:56.860
You taught me to see, not to
see but to really look deeper

00:00:56.860 --> 00:00:57.940
like you do--

00:00:57.940 --> 00:01:04.326
I already knew you'd leave me
someday with no cure for love

00:01:04.326 --> 00:01:07.300
that I had from the
moment I heard--

00:01:07.300 --> 00:01:08.290
--and from my--

00:01:08.290 --> 00:01:10.720
--your first word--

00:01:10.720 --> 00:01:12.680
Mama.

00:01:12.680 --> 00:01:19.850
You shaped the boy I become,
but the boy disappeared

00:01:19.850 --> 00:01:22.520
lost to the years--

00:01:22.520 --> 00:01:26.780
And the man you became
is a beautiful one,

00:01:26.780 --> 00:01:33.630
every bit still the same,
every bit still my son.

00:01:33.630 --> 00:01:41.540
But, oh, here we go with our
words and the battle's begun.

00:01:41.540 --> 00:01:49.180
And when the dust settles, I'm
sick as I see what I've done.

00:01:49.180 --> 00:01:55.060
If I could just tell you
that you more than deserved

00:01:55.060 --> 00:01:59.240
those three little
words I can't find.

00:01:59.240 --> 00:02:03.330
There is no other one--

00:02:03.330 --> 00:02:05.124
--you are my mother--

00:02:05.124 --> 00:02:07.480
--you are my son--

00:02:07.480 --> 00:02:08.389
--you are mine.

00:02:17.900 --> 00:02:26.431
At times you rile me up just a
little bit, more than most do.

00:02:26.431 --> 00:02:30.610
You get on my nerves, and
I'm sure that I get on yours.

00:02:30.610 --> 00:02:32.740
Surely, we both do.

00:02:32.740 --> 00:02:37.270
Aren't we supposed to
say what we're feeling?

00:02:37.270 --> 00:02:44.290
Instead, I'm concealing my
heart and just offering guile.

00:02:44.290 --> 00:02:49.670
And when you smile,
it's my reflection.

00:02:49.670 --> 00:02:52.520
Mixed with everything I fear--

00:02:52.520 --> 00:02:54.410
all of my flaws--

00:02:54.410 --> 00:02:57.068
look what I've caused to appear.

00:03:00.660 --> 00:03:05.900
Why can't I say what
you most need to hear?

00:03:05.900 --> 00:03:10.100
Don't leave me stuck
in the dark, dear.

00:03:21.210 --> 00:03:28.810
Oh, here we go with our
words, and the battle's begun.

00:03:28.810 --> 00:03:36.370
And when the dust settles, I'm
sick as I see what I've done.

00:03:36.370 --> 00:03:42.344
If I could just tell you
that you more than deserved

00:03:42.344 --> 00:03:47.620
those three little
words I can't find.

00:03:47.620 --> 00:03:51.880
There is no other one--

00:03:51.880 --> 00:03:53.643
--you are my mother--

00:03:53.643 --> 00:03:56.050
--you are my son--

00:03:56.050 --> 00:03:58.510
--you are mine.

00:03:58.510 --> 00:04:01.800
If I could just tell you that--

